HAND-32 is a hardware target overlay for Retro-Go. It is not a fork
and does not include Retro-Go source.

  Retro-Go  https://github.com/ducalex/retro-go
  Author    ducalex (Alex Duchesne) and contributors
  License   GNU General Public License v2.0
            https://github.com/ducalex/retro-go/blob/master/COPYING

            Exceptions (from Retro-Go README):
              fMSX  — custom non-commercial license
              handy — zlib

When this overlay is applied to Retro-Go, the combined firmware is a
modified work of Retro-Go and must be distributed under Retro-Go's
licenses (GPLv2, plus the exceptions above). Provide corresponding
source: the ducalex/retro-go tree plus this overlay.

